  "A dashed outline means more was sold that month than was logged as picked, so the kept figure is unknown — usually picking that never got written down, sometimes a sale out of an earlier month’s harvest.": {"st":"Moeli o nang le mela e khaotsweng o bolela hore kgweding eo ho rekisitswe ho fetang seo se ngotsweng e le se kotutsweng, ka hona palo ya se setseng polasing ha e tsejwe — hangata ke kotulo e sa ngolwang, ka dinako tse ding ke thekiso ya kotulo ya kgwedi e fetileng pejana.","ve":"Mutsetse wa nnḓa wo kherwaho u amba uri kha uyo ṅwedzi hu na zwo rengiswaho zwo fhirisaho zwo ṅwalwaho sa zwo kaṋwaho, ngauralo mbalo ya zwo salaho bulasini a i ḓivhei — nga tshifhinga tshinzhi ndi u kaṋa ho sa ṅwalwaho, tshiṅwe tshifhinga ndi thengiso i bvaho kha khaṋo ya ṅwedzi wa kale."},
  "A new invoice": {"st":"Invoyese e ntjha","ve":"Invoisi ntswa","ts":"Invoyisi leyintshwa"},
  "A summary of your logged harvests, sales and costs — income consistency, cash flow and a track record, built only from what you have entered. Material for a conversation with a lender, not a credit score or a loan approval.": {"st":"Kakaretso ya dikotulo, dithekiso le ditshenyehelo tse ngotsweng — ho tsepama ha lekeno, phallo ya tjhelete le rekoto ya nako e fetileng, e hahilweng ho tswa ho seo feela o se kentseng. Ke thuso bakeng sa moqoqo le mobolekisi, e seng sekoro sa mokoloto kapa tumello ya kadimo.","ve":"Muvhigo muṱuku wa khaṋo, thengiso na mbadelo dzo ṅwalwaho — u fana ha mbuelo, u dzhena na u bva ha masheleni na rekhodo ya zwo itwaho, zwo vhumbiwa nga zwe na zwi ṅwala fhedzi. Ndi zwa kuvhudzisana na mubolekisi, a si kiredithi skoro kana u tendelwa mbolekano."},
  "A worked year from the Ubhejane Crèche demo farm: sales, costs, harvests and invoices. Your own books are not touched.": {"st":"Selemo se sebeditsweng ho tswa polasing ya mohlala ya Ubhejane Crèche: dithekiso, ditshenyehelo, dikotulo le diinvoyese. Dibuka tsa hao ha di a amiwa.","ve":"Ṅwaha wo ṅwalwaho zwoṱhe u bvaho kha bulasi ya tsumbo ya Ubhejane Crèche: thengiso, mbadelo, khaṋo na dzi-invoisi. Bugu dzaṋu a dzi kwamiwi.","ts":"Lembe leri tirhiweke ra purasi ra xikombiso ra Ubhejane Crèche: ku xavisa, tihakelo, ntshovelo ni tinvoyisi. Tirhekhodo ta wena a ti khumbiwi."},
  "AI-generated crop reference · add your own harvest photo below.": {"st":"Setshwantsho sa tshupiso sa sejalo se entsweng ke AI · eketsa setshwantsho sa hao sa kotulo ka tlase.","ve":"Tsumbo ya tshiliṅwa yo itwaho nga AI · engedzani tshifanyiso tshaṋu tsha khaṋo ngei fhasi.","ts":"Xifaniso xa xibyariwa lexi endliweke hi AI · engetela xifaniso xa ntshovelo wa wena laha hansi."},
