  "Each figure is a whole crop’s harvest counted in the month its picking starts — not what you pick during that month. Planning estimates, not promises.": {"st":"Palo e nngwe le e nngwe ke kotulo yohle ya sejalo e balwang kgweding eo ho kotulwa ho qalang ho yona — e seng seo o se kotulang kgweding eo. Ke dikakanyo tsa moralo, e seng dithembiso.","ve":"Mbalo nthihi na nthihi ndi khaṋo ya tshiliṅwa tshoṱhe i vhalwaho kha ṅwedzi une tshiliṅwa itshi tsha thoma u kaṋwa ngawo — a si zwine na zwi kaṋa kha uyo ṅwedzi. Ndi zwo elwaho zwa u pulana, a si zwo fulufhedziswaho.","ts":"Nhlayo yin'wana ni yin'wana i ntshovelo hinkwawo wa xibyariwa lowu hlayiwaka eka n'hweti leyi ku sunguriwaka ku tshovela ha yona — a hi leswi u swi tshovelaka eka n'hweti yoleyo. I swiringanyeto swa ku kunguhata, a hi switshembiso."},
  "Edit": {"st":"Fetola","ve":"Shandulani","ts":"Cinca"},
  "Editing": {"st":"Ho fetolwa","ve":"U shandula","ts":"Ku cinca"},
  "Editing cost": {"st":"Ho fetolwa tshenyehelo","ve":"U shandula mbadelo","ts":"Ku cinca xihakelo"},
  "Editing sale": {"st":"Ho fetolwa thekiso","ve":"U shandula thengiso","ts":"Ku cinca ku xavisa"},
  "Email": {"st":"Email","ve":"Email","ts":"Imeyili"},
  "Enter a positive quantity. Eggs and items need whole numbers.": {"zu":"Faka inani elingaphezu kuka-0. Amaqanda nezinto zidinga izinombolo eziphelele.","st":"Kenya bongata bo fetang 0. Mahe le dintho tse balwang di hloka dinomoro tse feletseng."},
  "Enter a product and a quantity greater than zero.": {"zu":"Faka umkhiqizo nenani elingaphezu kuka-0.","st":"Kenya sehlahiswa le bongata bo fetang 0.","ve":"Ṅwalani tshibveledzwa na tshivhalo tshi fhiraho 0.","ts":"Faka xilo ni nhlayo leyi tlulaka 0."},
  "Enter a product, a quantity greater than zero and the sale amount.": {"zu":"Faka umkhiqizo, inani elingaphezu kuka-0 nesamba semali etholakale ekudayisweni.","st":"Kenya sehlahiswa, bongata bo fetang 0 le tjhelete ya thekiso.","ts":"Faka xilo, nhlayo leyi tlulaka 0 ni mali ya ku xavisa."},
  "Enter the original paper invoice number or reference.": {"st":"Kenya nomoro kapa tshupiso ya invoyese ya mantlha ya pampiri.","ve":"Ṅwalani nomboro kana Ref ya invoisi ya phepha ya u thoma.","ts":"Tsala nomboro ya invoyisi ya papila ya ku sungula."},
  "Entries land in the month you recorded them. There is no date field on the logging forms yet, so a month you caught up on later will sit in the month you typed it.": {"st":"Dikenyelletso di wela kgweding eo o di ngotseng ho yona. Ha ho sebaka sa letsatsi difomong tsa ho ngola ho fihlela jwale, ka hona dikenyelletso tsa kgwedi eo o di ngotseng hamorao di tla bonahala kgweding eo o di kentseng ho yona.","ve":"Zwiṅwalwa zwi dzhena kha ṅwedzi we na zwi ṅwala ngao. A hu athu vha na fhethu ha ḓuvha kha dzifomo dza u ṅwala, ngauralo zwine na zwi ṅwala murahu ha tshifhinga zwi ḓo dzula kha ṅwedzi we na zwi ṅwala ngao.","ts":"Switsalwa swi nghena eka n'hweti leyi u swi tsaleke eka yona. A ku na xivandla xa siku eka mafomo yo tsala ku fikela sweswi, hikwalaho loko u tsala endzhaku ka nkarhi, swi ta tshama eka n'hweti leyi u swi tsaleke eka yona."},
  "Entries land in the month you recorded them; the logging forms have no date field yet.": {"st":"Dikenyelletso di wela kgweding eo o di ngotseng ho yona; difomo tsa ho ngola ha di so be le sebaka sa letsatsi.","ve":"Zwiṅwalwa zwi dzhena kha ṅwedzi we na zwi ṅwala ngao; dzifomo dza u ṅwala a dzi athu vha na fhethu ha ḓuvha.","ts":"Switsalwa swi nghena eka n'hweti leyi u swi tsaleke eka yona; mafomo yo tsala a ma nga ri na xivandla xa siku ku fikela sweswi."},
  "Entry saved.": {"st":"Kenyelletso e bolokilwe.","ve":"Tshiṅwalwa tsho vhulungwa.","ts":"Xitsalwa xi hlayisiwile."},
