  "For your R/m² records. Choose only if every line belongs to this area.": {"st":"Bakeng sa direkoto tsa hao tsa R/m². Kgetha feela ha mela yohle e le ya sebaka sena.","ve":"Kha rekhodo dzaṋu dza R/m². Khethani fhedzi arali mitsetse yoṱhe i tshi vha ya fhethu hu.","ts":"Eka tirhekhodo ta wena ta R/m². Hlawula ntsena loko milayini hinkwayo yi ri ya ndhawu leyi."},
  "For {kg} kg, that is roughly R{low}–R{high}.": {"zu":"Ku-{kg} kg, lokho cishe kungu-R{low}–R{high}.","st":"Bakeng sa {kg} kg, ke hoo e ka bang R{low}–R{high}.","ve":"Kha {kg} kg, zwi vha tsini na R{low}–R{high}.","ts":"Eka {kg} kg, hi ku ringanyeta i R{low}–R{high}."},
  "Free some device storage before linking this sale. Its existing record has not been changed.": {"st":"Lokolla sebaka se seng sa polokelo fonong pele o hokahanya thekiso ena. Rekoto ya yona e teng ha e a fetolwa.","ve":"Itani fhethu ha u vhulunga kha founu yaṋu ni sa athu hanganyisa thengiso iyi. Rekhodo yayo yo ḓi vha hone a yo ngo shandulwa.","ts":"Endla ndhawu eka foni ya wena u nga si hlanganisa ku xavisa loku. Rhekhodo ra loku leri nga kona a ri cinciwanga."},
  "Fruit & nuts": {"ve":"Mitshelo na dzinati","ts":"Mihandzu ni tinati"},
  "Fruit, nuts and other orchard produce are counted in these kilograms. Tap to show the vegetable beds on their own.": {"ve":"Mitshelo, dzinati na zwiṅwe zwo bveledzwaho kha ngade ya miri ya mitshelo zwi katelwa kha idzi kg. Kwamani u sumbedza mibhede ya miroho yone fhedzi.","ts":"Mihandzu, tinati ni swin'wana leswi humaka entangeni wa mirhi swi katsiwile eka kg leti. Thinta ku kombisa mibhede ya matsavu ntsena."},
