  "Invoice": {"st":"Invoyese","ve":"Invoisi","ts":"Invoyisi"},
  "Invoice and payment details": {"st":"Dintlha tsa invoyese le tefo","ve":"Zwa invoisi na u badela","ts":"Vuxokoxoko bya invoyisi ni ku hakeriwa"},
  "Invoice issue date": {"st":"Letsatsi la ho ntsha invoyese","ve":"Ḓuvha ḽa u ita invoisi","ts":"Siku leri invoyisi yi endliweke ha rona"},
  "Invoice saved and linked to the existing sale. Its quantity and income are counted once.": {"zu":"I-invoyisi ilondoloziwe futhi ixhunyaniswe nokuthengisa okukhona. Inani layo nemali engenile kubalwa kanye kuphela.","st":"Invoyese e bolokilwe mme e hokahantswe le thekiso e teng. Bongata ba yona le lekeno di balwa hang feela.","ve":"Invoisi yo vhulungwa nahone yo hanganyiswa na thengiso yo no ṅwalwaho. Tshivhalo tshayo na masheleni a dzhenaho zwi vhalwa luthihi.","ts":"Invoyisi yi hlayisiwile naswona yi hlanganisiwile ni ku xavisa loku sweswi ku nga kona. Nhlayo ya yona ni mali leyi nghenaka swi hlayiwa kan'we."},
  "Invoice saved on this device. Reconnect and save it again to update the crop sale book.": {"st":"Invoyese e bolokilwe fonong ena. Hokela marang-rang hape mme o e boloke hape ho ntlafatsa buka ya dithekiso tsa dijalo.","ve":"Invoisi yo vhulungwa kha founu iyi. Dzhenani hafhu kha inthanethe ni i vhulunge hafhu u vusuludza bugu ya thengiso ya zwiliṅwa.","ts":"Invoyisi yi hlayisiwile eka foni leyi. Va ni inthanete nakambe u yi hlayisa nakambe leswaku buku ya ku xavisa swibyariwa yi pfuxetiwa."},
  "Invoice saved on this device. The shared sales records have not confirmed yet.": {"st":"Invoyese e bolokilwe fonong ena. Direkoto tse arolelanwang tsa dithekiso ha di so e netefatse.","ve":"Invoisi yo vhulungwa kha founu iyi. Rekhodo dza thengiso dzo kovhelanwaho a dzi athu khwaṱhisedza.","ts":"Invoyisi yi hlayisiwile eka foni leyi. Tirhekhodo ta ku xavisa leti avelaniwaka a ti si tiyisisa."},
  "Invoice saved.": {"st":"Invoyese e bolokilwe.","ve":"Invoisi yo vhulungwa.","ts":"Invoyisi yi hlayisiwile."},
  "Invoice type": {"st":"Mofuta wa invoyese"},
  "Is this sale already in My Records?": {"st":"Na thekiso ena e se e ho Direkoto Tsa Ka?","ve":"Thengiso iyi yo no ṅwalwa kha Rekhodo dzanga?","ts":"Xana ku xavisa loku sweswi ku ri eka Tirhekhodo ta Mina?"},
  "Item and amount are required.": {"st":"Ntho le tjhelete di a hlokahala.","ts":"Xilo ni mali swa laveka."},
  "Keep the invoice, payment and quantity together.": {"zu":"Gcina i-invoyisi, inkokhelo nenani kuhlangene.","st":"Boloka invoyese, tefo le bongata hammoho.","ve":"Vhulungani invoisi, u badelwa na tshivhalo fhethu huthihi.","ts":"Invoyisi, ku hakeriwa ni nhlayo swi hlayisiwa swin'we."},
  "Keep the recorded growing area for this sale.": {"st":"Boloka sebaka sa ho lema se ngotsweng sa thekiso ena.","ve":"Dzulisani fhethu ha u lima ho ṅwalwaho ha thengiso iyi.","ts":"Hlayisa ndhawu yo kurisa leyi tsariweke ya ku xavisa loku."},
  "Keep the recorded payment date and paid status for this sale.": {"st":"Boloka letsatsi la tefo le boemo ba tefo tse ngotsweng tsa thekiso ena.","ve":"Dzulisani ḓuvha ḽa u badelwa ḽo ṅwalwaho na nyimele ya u badelwa ya thengiso iyi.","ts":"Hlayisa siku leri mali yi amukeriweke ha rona ni xiyimo xa ku hakeriwa xa ku xavisa loku leswi tsariweke."},
  "Keep the recorded produce, quantity, unit and total when documenting this sale.": {"zu":"Gcina umkhiqizo, inani, iyunithi nesamba okurekhodiwe uma kubhalwa i-invoyisi yalokhu kuthengisa.","st":"Boloka sehlahiswa, bongata, yuniti le palo ya kaofela tse ngotsweng ha o etsa invoyese ya thekiso ena.","ve":"Dzulisani zwo bveledzwaho zwo ṅwalwaho, tshivhalo, tshipimo na mbalo yoṱhe musi ni tshi vhumba invoisi ya thengiso iyi.","ts":"Hlayisa leswi humesiweke, nhlayo, xipimo ni mali hinkwayo leswi tsariweke loko u endla invoyisi ya ku xavisa loku."},
  "Kept at home, at shop prices": {"st":"Tse setseng hae, ka ditheko tsa mabenkele","ve":"Zwo salaho hayani, nga mitengo ya zwitoroni","ts":"Leswi tshameke ekaya, hi tintsengo ta switolo"},
  "Kilograms picked each month for {n} months, split into sold and kept on the farm.": {"st":"Dikilograma tse kotutsweng kgwedi le kgwedi ka dikgwedi tse {n}, di arotswe ka tse rekisitsweng le tse setseng polasing.","ve":"Kg dzo kaṋwaho ṅwedzi muṅwe na muṅwe nga minwedzi {n}, dzo avhiwa kha dzo rengiswaho na dzo salaho bulasini.","ts":"Kg leti tshoveriweke n'hweti yin'wana ni yin'wana eka tin'hweti ta {n}, leti avanyisiweke eka leti xavisiweke ni leti tshameke epurasini."},
  "Labour": {"st":"Mosebetsi","ve":"Mushumo","ts":"Ntirho"},
  "Learn": {"st":"Ithute","ve":"Gudani","ts":"Dyondza"},
  "Leave blank if it served the whole garden": {"st":"Se tlohele se se na letho haeba e ne e sebeletsa serapa sohle","ve":"Litshani hu si na tshithu arali zwo shumiswa kha ngade yoṱhe","ts":"Tshika xi nga tsariwanga loko xi tirhele ntanga hinkwawo"},
  "Leave empty to invoice under your own name. Add a logo in Account.": {"st":"Tlohela e se na letho ho etsa invoyese ka lebitso la hao. Eketsa logo ho Akhaonto.","ve":"Litshani hu si na tshithu u ita invoisi nga dzina ḽaṋu. Engedzani logo kha Akhaunthu.","ts":"Tshika ndhawu leyi yi nga tsariwanga leswaku u endla invoyisi hi vito ra wena. Engetela logo eka Akhawunti."},
  "Left out — no verified yield figure yet: {names}.": {"st":"Di siiwe — ha ho palo ya kotulo e netefaditsweng ho fihlela jwale: {names}.","ve":"Zwo litshiwa — a hu na mbalo ya khaṋo yo khwaṱhisedzwaho zwino: {names}.","ts":"Swi susiwile — a ku na nhlayo ya ntshovelo leyi tiyisisiweke ku fikela sweswi: {names}."},
  "Lima is reading...": {"st":"Lima e a bala...","ve":"Lima u khou vhala...","ts":"Lima u ri karhi a hlaya..."},
  "Lima needs a connection. Enter the cost yourself and keep the photo attached.": {"st":"Lima e hloka marang-rang. Kenya ditshenyehelo ka bowena mme o boloke setshwantsho se kentswe.","ve":"Lima u ṱoḓa inthanethe. Ṅwalani mbadelo ni ṋoṋe, tshifanyiso tshi dzule tsho engedzwa.","ts":"Lima u lava inthanete. Faka xihakelo hi wexe u tshika xifaniso xi khomekile."},
  "Lima needs a connection. You can still enter the cost and save this photo offline.": {"st":"Lima e hloka marang-rang. O sa ntse o kgona ho kenya ditshenyehelo le ho boloka setshwantsho sena ntle le marang-rang.","ve":"Lima u ṱoḓa inthanethe. Ni kha ḓi nga ṅwala mbadelo na u vhulunga tshifanyiso itshi ni si na inthanethe.","ts":"Lima u lava inthanete. U nga ha tsala xihakelo u hlayisa xifaniso lexi handle ka inthanete."},
  "Lima reads photos up to 4 MB. You can still save this original photo and enter the cost yourself.": {"st":"Lima e bala ditshwantsho tse fihlang ho 4 MB. O sa ntse o kgona ho boloka setshwantsho sena sa mantlha le ho kenya ditshenyehelo ka bowena.","ve":"Lima u vhala zwifanyiso zwi swikaho kha 4 MB. Ni kha ḓi nga vhulunga tshifanyiso itshi tsha u thoma na u ṅwala mbadelo ni ṋoṋe.","ts":"Lima u hlaya swifaniso ku fika eka 4 MB. U nga ha hlayisa xifaniso lexi xa ku sungula u faka xihakelo hi wexe."},
  "Line items": {"st":"Dintho tse ho invoyese","ve":"Mitsetse ya zwithu","ts":"Swilo"},
  "Load the recorded sale before saving this invoice.": {"st":"Jarolla thekiso e ngotsweng pele o boloka invoyese ena.","ve":"Ḓisani thengiso yo ṅwalwaho ni sa athu vhulunga invoisi iyi.","ts":"Rhwala ku xavisa loku tsariweke u nga si hlayisa invoyisi leyi."},
  "Loading crop areas…": {"st":"Ho jarolla dibaka tsa dijalo…","ve":"Fhethu ha zwiliṅwa hu khou ḓiswa…","ts":"Ku rhwala tindhawu ta swibyariwa…"},
  "Loading your sales…": {"st":"Ho jarolla dithekiso tsa hao…","ve":"Thengiso dzaṋu dzi khou ḓiswa…","ts":"Ku rhwala ku xavisa ka wena…"},
  "Loading…": {"st":"Ho jarolla…","ve":"Zwi khou ḓiswa…","ts":"Ku rhwala…"},
  "Local market": {"zu":"Imakethe yasendaweni","st":"Mmaraka wa lehae","ve":"Makete ya hafhano","ts":"Makete ya ndhawu"},
