  "Log a harvest": {"st":"Ngola kotulo","ve":"Ṅwalani khaṋo","ts":"Tsala ntshovelo"},
  "Log a sale or a cost and this chart draws itself. Two or three months of entries is enough to see a pattern.": {"st":"Ngola thekiso kapa tshenyehelo mme kerafo ena e a hlaha ka bo yona. Dikgwedi tse pedi kapa tse tharo tsa dikenyelletso di lekane ho bona mokgwa.","ve":"Ṅwalani thengiso kana mbadelo nahone tshitshati itshi tshi ḓo ḓi vhonala. Zwiṅwalwa zwa minwedzi mivhili kana miraru zwi a swikelela u vhona uri zwi tshimbila hani.","ts":"Tsala ku xavisa kumbe xihakelo, kutani chati leyi yi ta tikombisa hi yexe. Switsalwa swa tin'hweti timbirhi kumbe tinharhu swi ringene ku vona xivumbeko."},
  "Log at least one harvest, sale or cost first — there is nothing to summarise yet.": {"st":"Ngola bonyane kotulo e le nngwe, thekiso kapa tshenyehelo pele — ha ho letho la ho akaretsa ho fihlela jwale.","ve":"Ṅwalani khaṋo, thengiso kana mbadelo nthihi kana u fhira u thoma — a hu na tshine tsha pfufhifhadzwa zwino.","ts":"Sungula hi ku tsala xitsalwa xin'we kumbe switsalwa swo tala swa ntshovelo, ku xavisa kumbe xihakelo — a ku na nchumu wo katsakanya ku fikela sweswi."},
  "Log cost": {"st":"Ngola tshenyehelo","ve":"Ṅwalani mbadelo","ts":"Tsala xihakelo"},
  "Log crop sales and see your earnings over time.": {"st":"Ngola dithekiso tsa dijalo mme o bone lekeno la hao ha nako e ntse e feta.","ve":"Ṅwalani thengiso ya zwiliṅwa nahone ni vhone mbuelo yaṋu nga tshifhinga.","ts":"Tsala ku xavisa swibyariwa u vona leswi u swi kumaka hi ku famba ka nkarhi."},
  "Log harvest": {"st":"Ngola kotulo","ve":"Ṅwalani khaṋo","ts":"Tsala ntshovelo"},
  "Log what you pick and what you sell, and this graph shows how much of your harvest is leaving the farm and how much is staying on it.": {"st":"Ngola seo o se kotutsang le seo o se rekisang, mme kerafo ena e bontsha hore na kotulo e kae e tswang polasing le hore na e kae e setseng ho yona.","ve":"Ṅwalani zwine na zwi kaṋa na zwine na zwi rengisa, nahone tshitshati itshi tshi ḓo sumbedza uri khaṋo yo bvaho bulasini yo vha ingana hani na ine ya dzula bulasini ya vha ingana hani.","ts":"Tsala leswi u swi tshovelaka ni leswi u swi xavisaka, kutani chati leyi yi ta kombisa leswaku ntshovelo wa wena wu humaka epurasini wu ringana ku yini ni lowu tshamaka eka rona."},
  "Marking an invoice paid adds its produce quantities to My Records in their recorded units.": {"zu":"Ukumaka i-invoyisi ikhokhiwe kwengeza amanani ayo omkhiqizo ku-Okurekhodiwe Kwami emayunithini awo arekhodiwe.","st":"Ho tshwaya invoyese e lefilwe ho eketsa bongata ba dihlahiswa ba yona ho Direkoto Tsa Ka ka dyuniti tseo di ngotsweng ka tsona.","ve":"U sumbedza invoisi sa yo badelwa hu engedza tshivhalo tsha zwo bveledzwaho kha Rekhodo dzanga nga zwipimo zwazwo zwo ṅwalwaho.","ts":"Ku kombisa leswaku invoyisi yi hakeriwile swi engetela nhlayo ya leswi humesiweke eka Tirhekhodo ta Mina hi swipimo swa swona leswi tsariweke."},
  "Mobile": {"st":"Tjhelete ya fono","ve":"Masheleni a founu"},
  "Money in": {"st":"Tjhelete e kenang","ve":"Masheleni a dzhenaho","ts":"Mali leyi nghenaka"},
  "Money in against money out, month by month, from what you have recorded.": {"st":"Tjhelete e kenang e bapisitswe le tjhelete e tswang, kgwedi le kgwedi, ho tswa ho seo o se ngotseng.","ve":"Masheleni a dzhenaho a tshi vhambedzwa na a bvaho, ṅwedzi nga ṅwedzi, zwi bvaho kha zwine na zwi ṅwala.","ts":"Mali leyi nghenaka ni mali leyi humaka, n'hweti ni n'hweti, ku suka eka leswi u swi tsaleke."},
  "Money in {moneyIn} · Money out {moneyOut}": {"st":"Tjhelete e kenang {moneyIn} · Tjhelete e tswang {moneyOut}","ve":"Masheleni a dzhenaho {moneyIn} · Masheleni a bvaho {moneyOut}","ts":"Mali leyi nghenaka {moneyIn} · Mali leyi humaka {moneyOut}"},
  "Money out": {"st":"Tjhelete e tswang","ve":"Masheleni a bvaho","ts":"Mali leyi humaka"},
  "Money received minus recorded spending for these months. Unrecorded costs are not included.": {"st":"Tjhelete e fumanweng ha e tlosoa tjhelete e sebedisitsweng e ngotsweng ka dikgwedi tsena. Ditshenyehelo tse sa ngolwang ha di kenyelletswe.","ts":"Mali leyi u yi kumeke ku susa leswi u hakeleke leswi tsariweke eka tin'hweti leti. Tihakelo leti nga tsariwangiki a ti katsiwanga."},
  "Money you paid out": {"st":"Tjhelete eo o e lefileng","ve":"Masheleni ane na a badela","ts":"Mali leyi u yi hakeleke"},
