  "Paid invoice crop lines enter the sales book automatically and count once. Do not enter them again.": {"st":"Mela ya dijalo ya diinvoyese tse lefilweng e kena bukeng ya dithekiso ka bo yona mme e balwa hang feela. Se ke wa e kenya hape.","ve":"Mitsetse ya zwiliṅwa kha dzi-invoisi dzo badelwaho i dzhena kha bugu ya thengiso i tshi ṋoṋe nahone i vhalwa luthihi. Ni songo zwi ṅwala hafhu.","ts":"Milayini ya swibyariwa ya invoyisi leyi hakeriweke yi nghena eka buku ya ku xavisa hi yexe, naswona yi hlayiwa kan'we. U nga yi tsali nakambe."},
  "Paid invoices add income and produce quantities to My Records in their recorded units. Unpaid invoices stay outstanding.": {"zu":"Ama-invoyisi akhokhiwe engeza imali engenile namanani omkhiqizo ku-Okurekhodiwe Kwami emayunithini awo arekhodiwe. Ama-invoyisi angakhokhiwe asala engakakhokhwa.","st":"Diinvoyese tse lefilweng di eketsa lekeno le bongata ba dihlahiswa ho Direkoto Tsa Ka ka dyuniti tseo di ngotsweng ka tsona. Diinvoyese tse sa lefilwe di sa ntse di lokela ho lefuwa.","ve":"Dzi-invoisi dzo badelwaho dzi engedza masheleni a dzhenaho na tshivhalo tsha zwo bveledzwaho kha Rekhodo dzanga nga zwipimo zwazwo zwo ṅwalwaho. Dzi-invoisi dzi sa athu badelwa dzi dzula dzi tshi lindela u badelwa.","ts":"Invoyisi leyi hakeriweke yi engetela mali leyi nghenaka ni nhlayo ya leswi humesiweke eka Tirhekhodo ta Mina hi swipimo swa swona leswi tsariweke. Invoyisi leyi nga hakeriwanga yi tshama yi nga hakeriwanga."},
